":doc:`../tutorials/3-start-first-strategy`，再回到本模块。"
msgstr ""
"**If you have not yet completed backtesting or are using qteasy for the "
"first time, it is recommended that you read :doc:`../getting_started` and "
":doc:`../tutorials/3-start-first-strategy` before returning to this module."

